{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<?ui-args --service-package tests/ui/service-events/reply.service.json?>\n<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"waiting\">\n  <state id=\"waiting\">\n    <invoke type=\"urn:example:reply\" id=\"reply\"/>\n    <transition event=\"reply.ready\" target=\"done\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml096-service-event-schema-missing.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":0,"notes":1,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml096-service-event-schema-missing.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":0,"byteOffset":298,"endColumn":50,"endLine":5,"startColumn":50,"startLine":5},"insertedContent":{"text":" xmlns:event=\"https://github.com/stateforward/scxml.rs/namespaces/event\" event:schema='{\"properties\":{\"text\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"text\"],\"type\":\"object\"}'"}}]}],"description":{"text":"add the schema the package declares for `reply.ready`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"note","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml096-service-event-schema-missing.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":36,"endLine":5,"startColumn":17,"startLine":5}}}],"message":{"markdown":"this transition handles `reply.ready` from an invoked service without an `event:schema`\n\n**Note:** the service package of `urn:example:reply` declares that it emits `reply.ready` with the schema `{\"properties\":{\"text\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"text\"],\"type\":\"object\"}`\n\n**Help:** describe the event data the transition handles with the package's schema (`event:schema`)\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §6.4 <invoke>","text":"this transition handles `reply.ready` from an invoked service without an `event:schema`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":284,"start":265},"category":"package"},"ruleId":"SCXML096"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"note"},"fullDescription":{"text":"a service package may declare the events its invoked service emits, each with a JSON Schema for the event's data; a transition in the state that invokes the service, or in a descendant of it, that names such an event exactly can describe that data with the package's schema, so readers, tools, and the decision namespace see the contract where the event is handled. Reported only for the service packages the validator was given"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: add the package's schema with `event:schema` (the `maybe-incorrect` fix inserts it, declaring the `event` namespace on the transition when no prefix for it is in scope).\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §6.4 <invoke>\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain SCXML096` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#invoke","id":"SCXML096","name":"SCXML096","properties":{"category":"package"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a transition handles an event a bound service package declares, without an `event:schema`"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}